[node name="DamagedCorridor" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "THE SHORTCUT (DamagedCorridor). A cracked walkway over the pit; origin = centre of the deck top. Load on it (LoadArea) above `tolerance` piles on stress; impacts add more. A SupportJack extended at the JackPoint (in the pit, under the deck) adds jack_bonus.
At 100% stress the Slabs drop into the pit."
script = ExtResource("1_damage")

